{"id":"d4d648cbb987de36","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-jump-operator.md","title":"Turing Jump and Its Existence Predicate","display":"df-jump-operator — Turing Jump and Its Existence Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-jump-operator","aliases":["62-df-jump-operator"],"display":"df-jump-operator — Turing Jump and Its Existence Predicate","depends_on":["[[62-df-oracle-computation]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Remark I.3.4; Definition VIII.1.9; Exercise VIII.1.12","source_pages":[8,312,313],"source_pdf_pages":[26,330,331]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-jump-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-jump-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jump-operator — Turing Jump and Its Existence Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06104e9b3d35ed9d\" href=\"?note=06104e9b3d35ed9d\" title=\"62-df-oracle-computation\">62-df-oracle-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Remark I.3.4; Definition VIII.1.9; Exercise VIII.1.12"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>8</span><span>312</span><span>313</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>26</span><span>330</span><span>331</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>有效编号及停机谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06104e9b3d35ed9d\" href=\"?note=06104e9b3d35ed9d\" title=\"62-df-oracle-computation\">62-df-oracle-computation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,Y\">\\(A,Y\\)</span> 为数的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf J\">\\(\\mathsf J\\)</span> 是标准元理论中的集合值算子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Jump}\">\\(\\mathsf{Jump}\\)</span> 是对象语言谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf{Jump}(A,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\forall e\\;(e\\in Y\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\;(\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow=y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf{Jump}(A,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\forall e\\;(e\\in Y\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\;(\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow=y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf J(A)\\coloneqq A&#39;\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf J(A)\\coloneqq A&#39;\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对象语言中始终用 Jump(A,Y) 判断已给定 Y，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\exists Y\\mathsf{Jump}(A,Y)\">\\(\\forall A\\exists Y\\mathsf{Jump}(A,Y)\\)</span> 才是跳跃存在原则。RCA₀ 不能因元理论中定义了 J 就获得内部跳跃集。书中 VIII.1.9 以一个固定通用公式定义 TJ 的特定代码集；本目录保留常用对角停机集编号，与书中 TJ 均匀 Turing 等价，不能声称二者逐项相等。所有刻画只依赖该有效等价和存在性。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Remark I.3.4; Definition VIII.1.9; Exercise VIII.1.12；纸面页 8, 312, 313；PDF 页 26, 330, 331。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"06104e9b3d35ed9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"06104e9b3d35ed9d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有效编号及停机谓词见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]。$A,Y$ 为数的集合；$\\mathsf J$ 是标准元理论中的集合值算子，$\\mathsf{Jump}$ 是对象语言谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Jump}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}operator}\\vdash\\;\\mathsf{Jump}(A,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\forall e\\;(e\\in Y\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\;(\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow=y)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf J(A)\\coloneqq A'\\coloneqq\\{e\\in\\mathbb N:\\Phi_e^A(e)\\downarrow\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall A\\exists Y\\mathsf{Jump}(A,Y)","display":false}],"bytes":1558,"backlinks":[{"id":"8736a0ad823f4cb0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$、$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 均在标准元理论中解释；$\\mathsf J$ 见 [[62-df-jump-operator]]。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-jump-operator|Turing Jump and Its Existence Predicate]]"},{"id":"f1525607abf065f1","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]；Jump 见 [[62-df-jump-operator]]；算术停机编号见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]；参数 join 见 [[62-df-turing-join]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。"},{"id":"b6355356a3573e48","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$；$\\mathrm{ACA}_0$、$\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}$、$\\mathsf{TIdeal}$、$\\mathsf J$ 见 [[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-turing-ideal]]、[[62-df-jump-operator]]。"},{"id":"c183c4f51ea1c088","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论与 Cn 见 [[62-df-WKL0]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]；模型与 J 见 [[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-jump-operator]]，归约见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]；ACA₀ 的 jump 闭包见 [[62-thm-ACA0-omega-models]]，KL 刻画见 [[62-thm-ACA0-Konig-equivalence]]。在元理论中，$\\mathsf{Low}(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf J(A)\\le_T\\mathsf J(\\varnothing)$。"}],"outgoing":["06104e9b3d35ed9d"]}